Revision history for MCP-Hub

{{$NEXT}}
  - Initial release. A single HTTP MCP server (`mcp-hub`) that embeds any
    number of stdio MCP servers and in-process Perl MCP servers, exposes each
    of them to many agents on the machine as its own endpoint, decides per
    client which of them it may use, and prints ready-to-paste client
    configuration. A lot of MCP for very little RAM.
